/L are platform locators, not official codes. English is an explanatory translation. Knowledge bullets share the source stem ''should know''; language bullets share ''should be able to''.","statement_en":"Read and understand the main content of informational texts about style and fashion.","statement_hy":"կարդալ և հասկանալ «Ոճ և նորաձևություն» թեմայով տեղեկատվական տեքստերի հիմնական բովանդակությունը,","status":"review","topic_id":"f654e06c-691a-5162-8f6b-9937831efc89"},{"id":"ba63ae30-cb60-545b-9543-a4e9bcca2bf5","official_code":null,"requirement_level":"mandatory","sequence_order":6,"source_document_id":"563e2108-48b7-5f4f-8df5-5d8a31803335","source_locator":"Grade7.Topic1.L3","source_reference":"N 116-Ն · Grade 7 · Topic 1 · Language abilities 3","source_transcription_notes":"Exact outcome bullet text and punctuation retained; numbering stored in source_locator. K/L are platform locators, not official codes. English is an explanatory translation. Knowledge bullets share the source stem ''should know''; language bullets share ''should be able to''.","statement_en":"Use simple expressions to present developments in fashion that interest the learner.","statement_hy":"պարզ արտահայտություններով ներկայացնել նորաձևության մեջ իրեն հետաքրքրող զարգացումները,","status":"review","topic_id":"f654e06c-691a-5162-8f6b-9937831efc89"},{"id":"e1373c88-a286-5bd7-a896-07685d12c1c9","official_code":null,"requirement_level":"mandatory","sequence_order":7,"source_document_id":"563e2108-48b7-5f4f-8df5-5d8a31803335","source_locator":"Grade7.Topic1.L4","source_reference":"N 116-Ն · Grade 7 · Topic 1 · Language abilities 4","source_transcription_notes":"Exact outcome bullet text and punctuation retained; numbering stored in source_locator. K/L are platform locators, not official codes. English is an explanatory translation. Knowledge bullets share the source stem ''should know''; language bullets share ''should be able to''.","statement_en":"Present a prepared talk about a preferred style.","