.L5; route=classroom_assessed. This unit''s spoken exchange is excluded by the owner''s speaking decision. The wider Փ․1 standard is not declared universally oral. The missing official registry row is resolved by this import. Current framework reference is a semantic link to Annex 2, section 4, paragraph 10(4), not proof of the entire multi-language end-of-school outcome. Printed 2023 topic-level references remain separately preserved in source_snapshot. Automated author reconciliation; no independent reviewer.","reconciliation_id":"7f550cb9-79a9-5ca6-b55f-e04f66043825","subject_standard_references":["ՕԼ7-Հ-Փ․1","ՕԼ7-Հ-Փ․2"]},{"disposition":"new_official_outcome_missing","framework_references":["Հ4"],"learning_outcome_id":"657585dc-d6fd-5dcc-8e63-90e68db62d6c","mapping_notes":"T1.L6; route=teacher_reviewed_writing. S13 directly addresses description. S14 supports the same note through a real written audience and the additional written-interaction descriptor Փ․3. One accepted response supplies both targets; it is not two independent samples. No automatic pass threshold is adopted. The missing official registry row is resolved by this import. Current framework reference is a semantic link to Annex 2, section 4, paragraph 10(4), not proof of the entire multi-language end-of-school outcome. Printed 2023 topic-level references remain separately preserved in source_snapshot. Automated author reconciliation; no independent reviewer.","reconciliation_id":"7f550cb9-79a9-5ca6-b55f-e04f66043825","subject_standard_references":["ՕԼ7-Հ-Գ․1","ՕԼ7-Հ-Փ․3"]},{"disposition":"new_official_outcome_missing","framework_references":["Հ4"],"learning_outcome_id":"ca38490f-472c-58bd-a514-73e382421c3c","mapping_notes":"T1.L7; route=qualitative_support_only. Reflection and reasons in S14 provide limited supporting evidence. Do not automatically score clothing preferences, personal values or character, or claim that one note establishes the full attitude outcome. The missing official registry ro