ություն» թեմայով տեղեկատվական տեքստերի հիմնական բովանդակությունը,","subject_standard_references_snapshot":["ՕԼ7-Հ-Ը․1"]},{"curriculum_release_id":"e40991ee-ca0b-5666-a9f2-a3453de8fccb","framework_references_snapshot":["Հ4"],"learning_outcome_id":"ba63ae30-cb60-545b-9543-a4e9bcca2bf5","mapping_notes_snapshot":"T1.L3; route=classroom_assessed. Oral production stays classroom-assessed. No platform skill, question, pass/fail or automatic denominator is created. The missing official registry row is resolved by this import. Current framework reference is a semantic link to Annex 2, section 4, paragraph 10(4), not proof of the entire multi-language end-of-school outcome. Printed 2023 topic-level references remain separately preserved in source_snapshot. Automated author reconciliation; no independent reviewer.","official_code_snapshot":null,"requirement_level_snapshot":"mandatory","sequence_order_snapshot":6,"source_document_id":"563e2108-48b7-5f4f-8df5-5d8a31803335","source_locator_snapshot":"Grade7.Topic1.L3","source_transcription_notes_snapshot":"Exact outcome bullet text and punctuation retained; numbering stored in source_locator. K/L are platform locators, not official codes. English is an explanatory translation. Knowledge bullets share the source stem ''should know''; language bullets share ''should be able to''.","statement_en_snapshot":"Use simple expressions to present developments in fashion that interest the learner.","statement_hy_snapshot":"պարզ արտահայտություններով ներկայացնել նորաձևության մեջ իրեն հետաքրքրող զարգացումները,","subject_standard_references_snapshot":["ՕԼ7-Հ-Մ․1"]},{"curriculum_release_id":"e40991ee-ca0b-5666-a9f2-a3453de8fccb","framework_references_snapshot":["Հ4"],"learning_outcome_id":"e1373c88-a286-5bd7-a896-07685d12c1c9","mapping_notes_snapshot":"T1.L4; route=classroom_assessed. Prepared oral presentation stays classroom-assessed. No platform speaking workflow is introduced. The missing official registry row is resolved by this import. Current framework reference is a semantic link to Annex 2, section 4, paragraph 10(4), not proof of the entire multi-language end-of-school outcome. Printed 2023 topic-level references remain separately preserved in source_snapshot. Automated author reconciliation; no independent reviewer.","official_code_snapshot":null,"requirement_level_snapshot":"mandatory","sequence_order_snapshot":7,"source_document_id":"563e2108-48b7-5f4f-8df5-5d8a31803335","source_locator_snapshot":"Grade7.Topic1.L4","source_transcription_notes_snapshot":"Exact outcome bullet text and punctuation retained; numbering stored in source_locator. K/L are platform locators, not official codes. English is an explanatory translation. Knowledge bullets share the source stem ''should know''; language bullets share ''should be able to''.","statement_en_snapshot":"Present a prepared talk about a preferred style.","statement_hy_snapshot":"ներկայացնել նախապես պատրաստված ելույթ իր նախընտրած ոճի մասին,","subject_standard_references_snapshot":["ՕԼ7-Հ-Մ․3"]},{"curriculum_release_id":"e40991ee-ca0b-5666-a9f2-a3453de8fccb","framework_references_snapshot":["Հ4"],"learning_outcome_id":"bf96b8d0-448b-5823-bf34-587d25bf064b","mapping_notes_snapshot":"T1.L5; route=classroom_assessed. This unit''s spoken exchange is excluded by the owner''s speaking decision. The wider Փ․1 standard is not declared universally oral. The missing official registry row is resolved by this import. Current framework reference is a semantic link to Annex 2, section 4, paragraph 10(4), not proof of the entire multi-language end-of-school outcome. Printed 2023 topic-level references remain separately preserved in source_snapshot. Automated author reconciliation; no independent reviewer.","official_code_snapshot":null,"requirement_level_snapshot":"mandatory","sequence_order_snapshot":8,"source_document_id":"563e2108-48b7-5f4f-8df5-5d8a31803335","source_locator_snapshot":"Grade7.Topic1.L5","source_transcription_notes_snapshot":"Exact outcome bullet text and punctuation retained; numbering stored in source_locator. K/L are platform locators, not official codes. English is an explanatory translation. Knowledge bullets share the source stem ''should know''; language bullets share ''should be able to''.","statement_en_snapshot":"Ask and answer questions about fashion, clothing styles and a preferred style.","statement_hy_snapshot":"տալ հարցեր նորաձևության, հագուստի ոճերի և իր նախընտրած ոճի մասին և պատասխանել այս թեմաներով իրեն ուղղված հարցերին,","subject_standard_references_snapshot":["ՕԼ7-Հ-Փ․1","ՕԼ7-Հ-Փ․2"]},{"curriculum_release_id":"e40991ee-ca0b-5666-a9f2-a3453de8fccb","framework_references_snapshot":["Հ4"],"learning_outcome_id":"657585dc-d6fd-5dcc-8e63-90e68db62d6c","mapping_notes_snapshot":"T1.L6; route=teacher_reviewed_writing. S13 directly addresses description. S14 supports the same note through a real written audience and the additional written-interaction descriptor Փ․3. One accepted response supplies both targets; it is not two independent samples. No automatic pass threshold is adopted. The missing official registry row is resolved by this import. Current framework reference is a semantic link to Annex 2, section 4, paragraph 10(4), not proof of the entire multi-language end-of-school outcome. Printed 2023 topic-level references remain separately preserved in source_snapshot. Automated author reconciliation; no independent reviewer.","official_code_snapshot":null,"requirement_level_snapshot":"mandatory","sequence_order_snapshot":9,"source_document_id":"563e2108-48b7-5f4f-8df5-5d8a31803335","source_locator_snapshot":"Grade7.Topic1.L6","source_transcription_notes_snapshot":"Exact outcome bullet text and punctuation retained; numbering stored in source_locator. K/L are platform locators, not official codes. English is an explanatory translation. Knowledge bullets share the source stem ''should know''; language bullets share ''should be able to''.","statement_en_snapshot":"Compose a simple 80–100-word text describing a preferred style.","statement_hy_snapshot":"կազմել իր նախընտրած ոճը նկարագրող պարզ տեքստ (80 – 100 բառ),","subject_standard_references_snapshot":["ՕԼ7-Հ-Գ․1","ՕԼ7-Հ-Փ․3"]},{"curriculum_release_id":"e40991ee-ca0b-5666-a9f2-a3453de8fccb","framework_references_snapshot":["Հ4"],"learning_outcome_id":"ca38490f-472c-58bd-a514-73e382421c3c","mapping_notes_snapshot":"T1.L7; route=qualitative_support_only. Reflection and reasons in S14 provide limited supporting evidence. Do not automatically score clothing preferences, personal values or character, or claim that one note establishes the full attitude outcome. The missing official registry row is resolved by this import. Current framework reference is a semantic link to Annex 2, section 4, paragraph 10(4), not proof of the entire multi-language end-of-school outcome. Printed 2023 topic-level references remain separately preserved in source_snapshot. Automated author reconciliation; no independent reviewer.","official_code_snapshot":null,"requirement_level_snapshot":"mandatory","sequence_order_snapshot":10,"source_document_id":"563e2108-48b7-5f4f-8df5-5d8a31803335","source_locator_snapshot":"Grade7.Topic1.L7","source_transcription_notes_snapshot":"Exact outcome bullet text and punctuation retained; numbering stored in source_locator. K/L are platform locators, not official codes. English is an explanatory translation. Knowledge bullets share the source stem ''should know''; language bullets share ''should be able to''.","statement_en_snapshot":"Show a critical attitude to fashion while valuing self-expression through individual style.","statement_hy_snapshot":"դրսևորել նորաձևության նկատմամբ քննական վերաբերմունք՝ կարևորելով ինքնարտահայտումը անհատական ոճի միջոցով:","subject_standard_references_snapshot":["ՕԼ7-Մ-Վ.1","ՕԼ7-Մ-Հ/Ն․1","ՕԼ7-ՔՍՄ-Մ․2","ՕԼ7-ՔՍՄ-Տ․1"]}]'::jsonb);
